THIRD CONFIRMATION, from the paper's own prose
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
  '17 papers used SPSS ... R was used in 13 ... 3 papers used both'
  SPSS-involving = 17 + 3 = 20      R-involving = 13 + 3 = 16
